      "principle": "A release deed executed by a person who is not the de jure or de facto guardian of the minor is void.",
      "held": "The learned Subordinate Judge has held that Ex. A-1 having been executed by the 2nd defendant, who was not the plaintiff's de jure guardian, was void as per Section 11 of the Hindu Minority and Guardianship Act.",
